● If you forgot the password, how to log in to Jenkins dashboard?
● How to secure files and where to store them?
● How to monitor the pipeline and how to troubleshoot?
● What automation tools used from your project and why?
● Docker create and docker -it command — tell me about it, why it is used?
Docker build steps
